              "enableCommunications": false,
              "customNotes": "APP EXPERIENCE BEHAVIOR RULES\n\nDisplay the Summary section in exactly two lines, with one blank line between the two lines.\n\nLine 1:\nRun the process to find cost processing details. \n\nLine 2:\nLast Run Date : -- | Run Control: -- | Process ID : --\n\nFormatting rules:\n- Do not display empty labels or placeholder values.\n- Do not display a Title.\n- Do not add any extra text, narration, or headings."
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Display No Cost Process Run"
