              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate a valid messageListWidget  with below data. \n\n{\n  \"rows\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Transactions processed successfully\",\n      \"count\":  \"--\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Total cost processor errors\",\n      \"count\": \"--\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nFor each row in the input data:\n- Use the `text` field as the message text.\n- Use the `count` field as the badge text.\n- Set the `priority` field to \"warning\".\n\nEnsure the output is a properly formatted messageListWidget JSON object reflecting these requirements."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
