              "value": "Extract the Summary section from the text in:\n\n{{$context.$nodes.CONVERT_BASE64_INTO_ACTUAL_TEXT.$output.result}}\n\nThe Summary section may be identified by a heading similar to:\n---Summary---\nor\n--------------------------Summary--------------------------\n\nIf no Summary section is found, return an empty string: \"\".\n\nAfter finding the Summary section, extract only the relevant summary lines that contain either of the following labels:\n\n1. Transactions processed successfully\n2. Total cost processor errors\n\nEach extracted line must include its corresponding count/value.\n\nReturn rules:\n\n- If both labels and their counts are available, return both rows.\n- If only one of the labels and its count is available, return JSON with only that row.\n- If the Summary section exists but neither label with a count is available, return an empty string: \"\".\n- If a label is present but its count/value is missing, do not return that row.\n- Do not infer or calculate missing values.\n\nReturn only the JSON object or an empty string.\n\nJSON format:\n\n{\n  \"rows\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Transactions processed successfully\",\n      \"count\": <count>\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Total cost processor errors\",\n      \"count\": <count>\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nDo not include explanations, markdown, or any extra text."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Convert Last Base64 Into Actual Text",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "const base64 = $context.$nodes.EXTRACT_LAST_COST_PROCESS_LOG_SUMMARY.$output.items[0].DocumentContent;\nconst text = decodeURIComponent(\n  Array.from(atob(base64))\n    .map(c => '%' + c.charCodeAt(0).toString(16).padStart(2, '0'))\n    .join('')\n);\nreturn text;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1778681501795"
          },
          "code": "CONVERT_LAST_BASE64_INTO_ACTUAL_TEXT",
          "id": "1778681435511",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
